    <text>
        <body>
            <div type="edition" xml:space="preserve">
                <ab>
					<lb n="1"/><supplied reason="undefined" evidence="previouseditor"><date from="1687-01-01" to="1687-12-31"><num value="1687">αχπζ</num></date></supplied>               
				</ab>
            </div>
            <div type="apparatus">
                <p>The date 1687 was recorded by Uspenskij; it was most likely given in Greek numerals. It is possible (but not very likely) that it was originally a date anno mundi and that Uspenskij converted it into anno domini, in which case it would have read 7195 or 7196 (ζρϞε/ζρϞς in Greek).</p>
            </div>
            <div type="translation">
                <p></p>
            </div>
            <div type="commentary">
                <p>The date referred either to the date of construction or to the fresco decoration.</p>
            </div>
